                <pb facs="0756" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg750"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Phelps.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic">May 16,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In view of British acceptance of proposition, notified by your telegram, this
                    Government acquiesces in modified date and accepts extension of Samoan land
                    commission until March 31, 1894. New American commissioner will be named
                    forthwith, vice Ormsbee, resigned yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
